WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.601 --> 00:00:03.234
-Well, it seems like there's so
much going on right now.

00:00:03.234 --> 00:00:05.033
Last night was the Rockefeller
Center Christmas tree got lit.

00:00:05.033 --> 00:00:06.868
The World Cup --
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:00:06.868 --> 00:00:09.601
The World Cup is in full swing.

00:00:09.601 --> 00:00:12.200
There's a new trailer for the
"Super Mario Bros. Movie."

00:00:12.200 --> 00:00:14.334
-Ooh!
-That looks good.

00:00:14.334 --> 00:00:15.801
And Subway just announced that

00:00:15.801 --> 00:00:18.267
they're going to sell
a foot-long cookie.

00:00:18.267 --> 00:00:19.734
There's a lot to go over,

00:00:19.734 --> 00:00:21.601
so let's just jump in
and cover it all at once.

00:00:21.601 --> 00:00:23.234
It's time for a "News Smash."

00:00:23.234 --> 00:00:25.234
♪♪
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:00:28.200 --> 00:00:30.501
First up, the Rockefeller Center
Christmas tree.

00:00:30.501 --> 00:00:31.834
Last night was the big lighting.

00:00:31.834 --> 00:00:33.901
Thousands of people
waited around for hours

00:00:33.901 --> 00:00:35.868
just for one second
of excitement.

00:00:35.868 --> 00:00:38.334
Yeah, it was
just like watching...

00:00:38.334 --> 00:00:39.534
the World Cup.

00:00:39.534 --> 00:00:41.167
Yeah.

00:00:41.167 --> 00:00:43.667
Games are long,
sometimes there's a tie,

00:00:43.667 --> 00:00:46.767
and the fans in Qatar
aren't even allowed to drink.

00:00:46.767 --> 00:00:48.834
But it hasn't stopped them
from enjoying the matches,

00:00:48.834 --> 00:00:51.234
which are full of
running, jumping, and kicking,

00:00:51.234 --> 00:00:52.234
kind of like...

00:00:52.234 --> 00:00:53.901
"Super Mario."

00:00:53.901 --> 00:00:55.801
The new trailer for
the movie just came out.

00:00:55.801 --> 00:00:58.100
Yeah, it's a whole movie
about a plumber,

00:00:58.100 --> 00:01:01.100
which is exactly who you'll
be calling if you eat a...

00:01:01.100 --> 00:01:03.634
foot-long cookie from Subway.

00:01:03.634 --> 00:01:06.734
That's right --
a giant 12-inch-long cookie.

00:01:06.734 --> 00:01:08.934
They're selling them
for National Cookie Day

00:01:08.934 --> 00:01:10.801
or, as stoners call it...

00:01:10.801 --> 00:01:11.834
Christmas.

00:01:11.834 --> 00:01:14.968
The tree is so beautiful
when it's lit.

00:01:14.968 --> 00:01:16.968
But you know
who isn't lit right now?

00:01:16.968 --> 00:01:20.234
Fans at the World Cup.
There's no booze.

00:01:20.234 --> 00:01:23.033
But they still went wild when
Team USA's best player scored

00:01:23.033 --> 00:01:25.200
while getting kneed
in the groin.

00:01:25.200 --> 00:01:26.934
Yeah, he took one
right in his...

00:01:26.934 --> 00:01:28.200
cookies.

00:01:28.200 --> 00:01:30.501
Seriously, if there's --
If you eat this whole thing,

00:01:30.501 --> 00:01:32.100
you won't be hitting your
weight-loss...

00:01:32.100 --> 00:01:34.968
goooooal!

00:01:34.968 --> 00:01:36.968
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:01:39.601 --> 00:01:42.200
There are 16 countries left,

00:01:42.200 --> 00:01:43.634
but there can only be
one winner.

00:01:43.634 --> 00:01:45.567
Right now,
every country is hoping...

00:01:45.567 --> 00:01:46.934
"it's a-me."

00:01:46.934 --> 00:01:48.801
So, in conclusion...

00:01:48.801 --> 00:01:50.267
what a star...

00:01:50.267 --> 00:01:51.467
in Qatar...

00:01:51.467 --> 00:01:52.934
"Super Mar"...

00:01:52.934 --> 00:01:54.234
you took it too far.

00:01:54.234 --> 00:01:56.067
This has been a "News Smash."

00:01:56.067 --> 00:01:58.067
♪♪
[ Cheers and applause ]

